From: Mr Slop Mizer <306584837+MrSlopster@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:48:21 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 80/82] drm/sun4i: add AC200 TV encoder (CVBS) bridge driver

DRM bridge for the composite video encoder in the X-Powers AC200,
registered as a child of the AC200 MFD. Provides a Composite connector
with NTSC 720x480 (default) and PAL 720x576 modes (module parameter
default_pal), using the register sequences of the Allwinner BSP and the
DAC calibration value from the H6 SID.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Kconfig            |  11 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile           |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_ac200_tve.c | 411 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 423 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_ac200_tve.c

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Kconfig b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Kconfig
index 4dac2dddf..119e88bf2 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Kconfig
@@ -76,6 +76,17 @@ config DRM_SUN8I_MIXER
 	  graphics mixture and feed graphics to TCON, If M is
 	  selected the module will be called sun8i-mixer.
 
+config DRM_SUN50I_AC200_TVE
+	tristate "Support for the X-Powers AC200 TV encoder"
